 ## Phases
 
-**Router:** `/design <TICKET>` — runs all seven phases in one session, stopping at each boundary for confirmation. Bail out at any point and resume with the individual command. One skill (`design`) owns all seven phases; Review, Address Feedback, and Publish stay independently invocable and resumable the same way they always did: `/design review-gate` opens the draft MR and the session pauses; `/design address-feedback` only runs if the approver raises concerns (loops back to an earlier phase, then re-approves); `/design publish` runs once the gate is approved.
+**Router:** `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design <TICKET>` — runs all seven phases in one session, stopping at each boundary for confirmation. Bail out at any point and resume with the individual command. One skill (`design`) owns all seven phases; Review, Address Feedback, and Publish stay independently invocable and resumable the same way they always did: `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design review-gate` opens the draft MR and the session pauses; `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design address-feedback` only runs if the approver raises concerns (loops back to an earlier phase, then re-approves); `{{SKILL_PREFIX}}design publish` runs once the gate is approved.
 
-| Phase                | Individual command                  | What it produces                                                                                                                            |
